cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "PARSEC-VL has no archival paper; cite this repository and the exact commit used."
title: "PARSEC-VL: Budget-Aware Parallel Planning and Speculative Execution for Multi-Agent Visual Reasoning"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  CISC 654 course project built on the OpenVLHarness visual-agent runtime:
  dependency-aware parallel execution of agent tool calls with typed resource
  pools and shared budgets (Phase 1), with parallel planning and speculation
  planned for later phases.
keywords:
  - parallel computing
  - task scheduling
  - visual agents
  - tool use
  - multi-agent systems
authors:
  - name: "PARSEC-VL contributors"
